{"id":609977,"title":"AE2 Things [Forge]","summary":"Introduces a new Cell type, advanced inscriber and crystal growth chamber ","description":"\u003ch2\u003eAE2 Things (Forge edition)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThis mod adds two machines from AE2Stuff the Advanced Inscriber and Crystal Growth Chamber, and a new type of cell the DISK: Deep Item Storage disK.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eRequires Forge and AE2. (This is a Forge port of the \u003ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2things\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eoriginal AE2 Things\u003c/a\u003e, created by ProjectET for Fabric.)\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eDiscussion on the AE2 Discord server: \u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/Zd6t9ka7ne\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://discord.gg/Zd6t9ka7ne\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n\u003ch4\u003eDISK - Deep Item Storage disK\u003c/h4\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eStorage cells that can store 1k, 4k, 16k and 64k items without any type limit. This cell has no type limits and one item counts as one byte. Due to limitations with the cell format, you lose 24 bytes per kibibyte, but hey a small price to pay for no types right? Note that they are more expensive than regular cells since they require a little netherite.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KmZ5mAX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"513\" height=\"550\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch4\u003eAdvanced Inscriber \u003cstrong\u003e[REMOVED IN 1.20 DUE TO THE AE2 INSCRIBER REWORK]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eInscriber without slot limits per stack and without annoying sided automation restrictions.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7TxvvUK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"713\" height=\"329\"\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch4\u003eCrystal Growth Chamber \u003cstrong\u003e[REMOVED IN 1.19 DUE TO THE AE2 CRYSTAL REWORK]\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eA machine to easily grow large amounts of crystals at once, or fluix dust. As a bonus, it will automatically send any finished item directly into your ME network!\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5cNu7Xo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"938\" height=\"299\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","game":"minecraft","type":"Mods","urls":{"curseforge":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-things-forge","project":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-things-forge"},"thumbnail":"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/333/256/256/637853160396640013.png","created_at":"2022-04-12T09:53:35.76Z","downloads":{"monthly":0,"total":36554429},"license":"","donate":"","categories":["Applied Energistics 2","Technology"],"members":[{"title":"Owner","username":"thetechnici4n","id":101370726},{"title":"Owner","username":"ProjectET","id":102114925}],"links":[],"files":[{"id":5637783,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-things-forge/files/5637783","display":"AE2 Things v1.4.2-beta","name":"AE2-Things-1.4.2-beta.jar","type":"beta","version":"1.21.1","filesize":66034,"versions":["NeoForge","1.21.1"],"downloads":923289,"uploaded_at":"2024-08-17T15:33:57.78Z"},{"id":5636154,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-things-forge/files/5636154","display":"AE2 Things v1.4.1-beta","name":"AE2-Things-1.4.1-beta.jar","type":"beta","version":"1.21.1","filesize":56254,"versions":["NeoForge","1.21.1"],"downloads":131,"uploaded_at":"2024-08-16T22:14:52.447Z"},{"id":5635466,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-things-forge/files/5635466","display":"AE2 Things v1.4.0-beta","name":"AE2-Things-1.4.0-beta.jar","type":"beta","version":"1.21.1","filesize":56229,"versions":["NeoForge","1.21.1"],"downloads":142,"uploaded_at":"2024-08-16T17:45:44.087Z"},{"id":5179436,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-things-forge/files/5179436","display":"AE2 T